  "key_sentences": [
    "The condensed interim financial statements were approved by the Board of Directors on 9 September 2026.",
    "All results relate to continuing operations.",
    "Gross margin improved from 30.6% to 31.3% as ingredient costs stabilised during the second quarter.",
    "The effective tax rate for the period was 25.0%, in line with the statutory rate.",
    "They do not include all the information required for full annual statements.",
    "The Board has declared an interim dividend of 3.1 pence per share, payable on 30 October 2026 to shareholders on the register on 2 October 2026."
